{"id":"209148","name":"泡萝卜","author":"馋嘴乐","authorId":"285245","desc":"","cover":"images/209148/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"白萝卜","amount":"1个"},{"name":"红辣椒","amount":"1个"}],"sub":[{"name":"姜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"白醋","amount":"适量"},{"name":"白糖","amount":"适量"},{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"主辅料：白萝卜、红辣椒、姜","img":"images/209148/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"把白萝卜洗净切块。","img":"images/209148/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"放入盆中，加适量盐腌渍2小时，然后攥干水分备用。","img":"images/209148/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"兑汁：碗中加姜丝、红辣椒丝、白糖。","img":"images/209148/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"加适量白醋搅拌均匀。","img":"images/209148/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"把兑好的汁倒入备用的萝卜里，腌渍24小时。","img":"images/209148/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"即可食用。","img":"images/209148/step_7.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}